BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF MUSI RAWAS,

Considering : 
a. that women and children are among vulnerable groups who tend to experience violence and therefore need to receive protection;

b. that violence against women and children continues to increase, therefore protection efforts are needed;

c. that all forms of violence against women and children constitute violations of law and human rights and therefore their dignity and honor need to be protected and their right to life guaranteed in accordance with their nature and disposition without discrimination;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on the Implementation of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

Recalling :

